    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d56">

                <pb facs="0118" n="704" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p2/pg704"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119–PW/4–1249</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chief of the Division of Northeast
                        Asian Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bishop</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Director of the
                        Office of Far Eastern Affairs</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Butterworth</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d56-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-04-12">April 12, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The attached comments on our Japanese reparations position (Tab A) were handed me
                    by General McCoy on Saturday, April 9. I recommend that you read them and, if
                    you agree, that you sign the attached letter in reply to General McCoy (Tab
                        B)<anchor n="2" xml:id="d56-f2"/> and then forward General McCoy’s comments
                    with copy of the letter to the Secretary for his information under cover of the
                    memorandum at Tab C.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d56-f3"/>
                </p>



                <xi:include href="d56-a1.xml" xpointer="d56-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d56-a2.xml" xpointer="d56-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d56-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d56-f1-content">
                <p>Notation by the Deputy Director (Allison): “This all seems OK to me but I believe
                    you will wish to read it in full. JMA”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d56-f2" n="2" xml:id="d56-f2-content">
                <p>For letter dated April 15, see <ref target="#pg707">p. 707</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d56-f3" n="3" xml:id="d56-f3-content">
                <p>Dated April 14, not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
